; pattern-pure-euclid: one literal hap and one Euclidean rhythm. At 120 bpm
; 4/4 a bar is 2.0 s and is also one pattern cycle; the eight slots are
; quarter-bar steps. E(3,8) is x..x..x. (slots 0, 3, 6), so slots 1, 2, 4
; and 5 have no active hap and their writes are omitted.
(transport :bpm 120 :meter [4 4])

(track :target value :pattern (pure 0.25))
(track :target pulse :pattern (euclid 3 8 0.8))
